Subject: [PATCH 4/6] C1 seam-layout fill: the target proved

exists_seamLayoutTM proved in full: the start rewrap, the eight hosted
phases chained by runFrom_add, the closed-form time
T = 2n - r + 4h + 5q + 2|v| + 23 <= 18(n + 1) split over the ledger
(n-r+1, n+3, h, q+3, q+2, 2|v|+2, h+q+3, 2(h+q)+2, seven dispatches),
the triple-update endpoint and inputPos frame, silence at every u <= T
by the output-prefix sandwich, and the first-visit cut by the eight
lockstep windows. No sorry; no new warning.

